---
title: Fluffy White Uncooked Frosting
author: Judy White
category: Frostings
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@egg white{1}
@cream of tartar{1/4%tsp}
@vanilla{1/2%tsp}
@sugar{1%c}
@boiling water{1/2%c}

Combine egg white, sugar and cream of tartar in large bowl. Add boiling water and begin at once to beat until thick. Add vanilla.
